      "id": "nvda-mdna-datacenter",
      "type": "narrative",
      "answer": "NVIDIA's fiscal 2026 MD&A says Data Center revenue grew 68% year over year, driven by the major platform shifts to accelerated computing and AI. Within that, Data Center compute revenue grew 59% on demand for the Blackwell computing platform, and Data Center networking revenue grew 142% from the introduction and ramp of NVLink compute fabric for GB200 and GB300 systems plus growth in Ethernet and InfiniBand.",
